out/*
!out/results.csv
# The raw rows behind the published table. RESULTS.md names this file as the
# source, and a document that points at data the repository does not contain is
# how the last provenance chain broke: the page said "re-measured 2026-08-23"
# while the newest committed row was 08-15.
!out/matrix.csv
# Same reason, for the A/B driver's rows. JITLESS.md and CODEGEN.md both publish
# tables whose only raw source is this file; it was ignored while they were
# written, so both pages shipped pointing at data that was not here.
!out/jitless_ab.csv
**/build/
**/.gradle/
*.apk
shells/migo-shell/app/libs/*.aar
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
# generated by scripts/make-stress-game.sh (normal bundle + a ~250-byte ramp patch)
games/bunnymark-stress/*.js
games/bunnymark-stress/index.html
shells/*/app/src/main/assets/game-stress/*.js
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Conformance bundles are copied in by migo-conformance runners at run time.
shells/*/app/src/main/assets/game-conf-*/
shells/*/app/src/main/assets/game-callbacks/
